#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:5
#: ed6a7c9270044fc789d62ee0922db3b7
msgid "The Cube Yellow Overview"
msgstr "The Cube Yellow 概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:12
#: cd6f4d7919b74368ae5de5431a8c475c
msgid "System Features"
msgstr "系统特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:14
#: aa97e2bb253d4c6e93982722d4f5d419
msgid ""
"The Cube Yellow autopilot is a new model in the Cubepilot ecosystem, "
"designed for hobby users, commercial system integrators and UAS "
"manufacturers the Cube Yellow is based on the Arm STM32F7 series SOC. "
"Sitting directly between the Cube Black and Orange this model offers better "
"performance and newer sensors over the Cube Black while retaining F series "
"SOC compatibility."
msgstr ""
"The Cube Yellow 飞控是 Cubepilot 生态系统中的新型号，专为业余用户、商业系统集成商和无人机制造商设计，基于 ARM "
"STM32F7 系列 SOC。处于 Cube Black 和 Orange 之间，该型号在保留 F 系列 SOC 兼容性的同时，提供了比 Cube "
"Black 更好的性能和更新的传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:16
#: 4dc0f701666e47f2acd9dbc3bcf86f3b
msgid ""
"Just like the other models the Yellow is part of a wide ecosystem of "
"autopilot modules and carrier boards. All the Cube models are compatible "
"with all of the carriers which allows users to choose an off the shelf "
"carrier board design that best suits their needs. System designers are able "
"to integrate the Cube directly into their designs via published carrier "
"board specifications."
msgstr ""
"与其他型号一样，Yellow 是飞控模块与载板广泛生态系统的一部分。所有 Cube "
"型号均与所有载板兼容，用户可选择最适合自己需求的现成载板设计。系统设计人员可通过发布的载板规格将 Cube 直接集成到其设计中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:20
#: d70b85b4439947d4949c5a3709586adb
msgid "Cube Yellow Features"
msgstr "Cube Yellow 特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:22
#: 9f71c6a7f0d242d08316c75fddbc50e9
msgid "Faster F7 SOC with 512KB ram"
msgstr "更快的 F7 SOC，配备 512KB RAM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:23
#: 49d7a309e99b4108ab5c2bf170864ef8
msgid "Upgraded triple redundant IMU sensors for extra redundancy"
msgstr "升级的三重冗余 IMU 传感器，提供额外冗余"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:24
#: 889a3c85bf054bfca0c9e80746caa446
msgid ""
"2 sets of IMU are vibration-isolated mechanically, reducing the effect of "
"frame vibration to state estimation"
msgstr "2 组 IMU 通过机械减震隔离，降低机架震动对状态估计的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:25
#: 9f8d07b80056469aaba6feb90c38d89f
msgid ""
"IMUs are temperature-controlled by onboard heating resistors, allowing "
"optimum working temperature of IMUs"
msgstr "IMU 通过板载加热电阻进行温控，使 IMU 保持最佳工作温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:26
#: 8c46855288254fb6b09f898ee7b27793
msgid ""
"The entire flight management unit(FMU) and inertial management unit(IMU) are"
" housed in a reatively small form factor (a cube)."
msgstr "整个飞行管理单元（FMU）和惯性管理单元（IMU）集成在相对小巧的外形（方块）中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:27
#: d3f65f6f23cf45b1b7187beb32c10256
msgid ""
"Fully Cubepilot carrierboard compatible, all inputs and outputs go through a"
" 80-pin DF17 connector, allowing a plug-in solution for manufacturers of "
"commercial systems. Manufacturers can design their own carrier boards to "
"suit their specific needs now and in the future."
msgstr ""
"与 Cubepilot 载板完全兼容，所有输入输出均通过 80 针 DF17 "
"连接器连接，为商业系统制造商提供即插即用方案。制造商可根据当前及未来的特定需求设计自己的载板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:30
#: 5462f49ad623428ebd67c17958c1a61f
msgid "Specifications"
msgstr "规格参数"

